2026-08-16T12:15:32Z    [ADI:Adjusted gross margin] GATE critic: The +0.500 pp “post-guidance signal tilt” is not based on ADI guidance. One of your cited quotes references “record orders for our Data Center segment,” but ADI does not report a Data Center segment (ADI’s end markets are Industrial, Automotive, Communications, and Consumer). That +0.40 signal (and thus the +0.50 pp uplift) is coming from another company, so the 72.45% rests on the wrong basis; absent that uplift, your figure would be 71.95%.
